        "title": "Checkout was down for 47 minutes on 9 March",
        "lede": "A TLS certificate on the payments proxy expired. Customers could browse but not pay, and 1,184 checkouts failed.",
        "meta": [
          {
            "label": "Author",
            "value": "Rosa Okafor"
