          },
          {
            "type": "Text",
            "props": {
              "style": "muted",
              "content": "All times are CET. Sources: proxy logs, alerting and the incident channel."
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Section",
        "props": {
          "title": "Root cause"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Text",
            "props": {
              "content": "The payments proxy holds its own TLS certificate, separate from the main site. It was issued by hand in March 2025 with a one-year lifetime and was never added to the automatic renewal job.\n\nReminders were sent 30, 14 and 3 days before expiry. All three went to the `infra-alerts` mailbox, which was set up for a team that was merged in 2025.\n\nDiagnosis took 23 minutes because the error surfaced as a payment failure. The first responder checked the payment provider before the proxy."
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Section",
        "props": {
          "title": "What worked and what did not",
          "layout": "split"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Text",
            "props": {
              "content": "### Worked\n\n- The error-rate alert fired within 6 minutes.\n- The fix was live 11 minutes after diagnosis.\n- Support had a banner on the site by 09:30."
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Text",
            "props": {
              "content": "### Did not work\n\n- Expiry reminders had no owner.\n- The runbook for payment errors did not mention the proxy.\n- Both proxies shared one certificate, so both failed together."
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Section",
        "props": {
          "title": "Actions"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "props": {
              "caption": "Follow-up actions",
              "headers": [
                "Action",
                "Owner",
                "Due",
                "Status"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Add all 14 certificates to automatic renewal",
                  "D. Varga",
                  "13 Mar",
                  {
                    "badge": "Done",
                    "tone": "success"
                  }
                ],
                [
                  "Page on-call 21 days before any certificate expires",
                  "D. Varga",
                  "13 Mar",
                  {
                    "badge": "Done",
                    "tone": "success"
                  }
                ],
                [
                  "Add a proxy check to the payment-error runbook",
                  "R. Okafor",
                  "20 Mar",
                  {
                    "badge": "In progress",
                    "tone": "active"
                  }
                ],
                [
                  "Issue a separate certificate for each proxy",
                  "M. Lindqvist",
                  "3 Apr",
                  {
                    "badge": "Planned",
                    "tone": "neutral"
                  }
                ]
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
